    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automatic Editorial Blog\n\nWrite, review and publish sourced articles using OpenAI nodes and a compatible editorial API.\n\n### How it works\n- **Claim:** Reserve a due topic and its budget.\n- **Write:** Generate and archive a sourced draft.\n- **Review:** Assess the draft independently and allow one correction.\n- **Publish:** Publish approved content once and verify the live page.\n\n### Setup\n- Connect OpenAI and editorial API credentials.\n- Set the four API URLs and your public blog origin.\n- Configure your backend and test before activation.\n\n### Customization\n- **Content:** Set topics, sources, prompts and schemas in your API.\n- **Automation:** Adjust the schedule, budget and correction limits.\n\n### Requirements\n- n8n with OpenAI, Code and HTTP Request nodes.\n- OpenAI API access.\n- Editorial API with persistent state and CMS publishing.\n\n### Additional info\n- [Full documentation](https://paoloronco.notion.site/Automatic-Editorial-Blog-Native-OpenAI-424f0ba27c3281828db5f28abc20a6e3)\n- [Setup guide and workflow files](https://github.com/paoloronco/n8n-templates/tree/main/workflows/automatic-editorial-blog)\n- **Support:** [info@paoloronco.it](mailto:info@paoloronco.it) · [paoloronco.it](https://paoloronco.it/)",
        "height": 588,
        "width": 550
      },
